PSEUDOCODE
Declare Arrays for: userItems[50], itemQuantity[50], itemPrice[50], total[50]
index = 0
collect customer name and cashier name
set boolean Shopping to true
WHILE shopping is true:
    collect product name i.e userItems[index]
    collect item price i.e itemPrice[index]
    collect quantity i.e itemQuantity[index]
total[index] = itemPrice[index] * itemQuantity[index]
index + 1

prompt user for if to Add more items
if choice is "no", shopping = false
oherwise the loop runs again

calculate the bill
subtotal = sum of all total[0] to total[index-1]
discount = subtotal * 0.10
vat      = subtotal * 0.075
billTotal = subtotal - discount + vat

Print the Receipt & summary
store name, branch, location, telephone, cashier name, customer name, Item,  Qty,  Price , Total, subtotal, discount, vat, billTotal

Check for amount paid
balance = amount paid - billTotal
print the balance

